      en: ["St. Michael's Church in Finström was built in the late 13th century.", "Finström is the hub of apple production in the Åland Islands.", "Godby is the second-largest commercial center in Åland after Mariehamn.", "The municipality was the ecclesiastical center of Åland in the Middle Ages.", "Finström covers a land area of approximately 123 square kilometers.", "Several significant Viking-age archaeological sites are located here."],
