      en: ["The Jyväskylä rural municipality was annexed to the city on January 1, 2009.", "Tikkakoski is the location of the Finnish Air Force headquarters.", "Lake Päijänne forms a natural border in the southern rural parts.", "The area is a key hub for sustainable Finnish forest industries.", "Vaajakoski is famous for its historic chocolate factory and river locks.", "The landscape features several geologically significant glacial ridges."],
